OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOften cloudy with showers or
OL,6,Foccasionally longer spells of rain.
OL,7,FShowers becoming lighter across the
OL,8,Fnorthwest during the afternoon. Fresh
OL,9,Fto strong west or northwesterly winds,
OL,10,Fcoastal gales. Rather cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers mostly dying out this
OL,13,Fevening although a few continuing
OL,14,Facross the far northwest. Otherwise
OL,15,Fbecoming dry with clear periods and
OL,16,Feasing winds. Chilly in some sheltered
OL,17,Fglens.
OL,18,
OL,19,CWednesday:FChance of a light shower
OL,20,Falong the west coast at first,
OL,21,Fotherwise dry with bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
