OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fin the morning on Thursday before rain
OL,7,Fspreads east in the afternoon and
OL,8,Fevening. Mainly dry on Friday, a few
OL,9,Flight showers. Rain likely on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
